"""The hand-written layer for the default niche list: the 99 niches + 20 business types of the owner's own spec document ("Content AI: training prompts",
read into corecraft/data/niche_spec.json by training/import_niches.py). For each niche: which text bank (family) it uses, its sample prices, Devanagari keywords, button,
team and menu; the 20 business types; and the map between these niches and the author's own 77 business types (corecraft/business_types.py).
training/build_niches.py reads this and writes corecraft/data/niches.json (the default list) and corecraft/data/author_niches.json (the 77-type list, which reuses
the prices, buttons, teams and menus of a niche that is clearly the same business). The pack writer reads only the two JSON files at run time."""


